<title>USA: Chicago Bridge &amp; Iron prices IPO.</title>
<headline>Chicago Bridge &amp; Iron prices IPO.</headline>
<dateline>DANBURY, Conn 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Praxair Inc said Sunday that its subsidiary will sell up to 10.5 million shares at $20 to $23 per share in the initial public offering of Chicago Bridge &amp; Iron Co NV.</p>
<p>Praxair said it has also granted managing underwriters an option to buy an additional one milllion shares, which, if exercised, would reduce its ownership to zero.</p>
<p>Praxair had previously announced its plans to divest Chicago Bridge &amp; Iron, a provider of steel plate structures that had 1995 sales of about $620 million.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
